{
  "about": "A whole page to decide with: rent or buy, both sides of the comparison worked out, a choice of city whose formula compares it by name, a toggle, a chart of both costs over the years, facts about the market (with nothing read, so it goes back to look them up), and a verdict.",
  "wire": {
